ce":"孔、暴之屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"朱彊","kind":"person","person_id":"1iw_7ww_ynr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"杜衍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0179","start":179,"end":181,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0212","start":212,"end":213,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0231","start":231,"end":235,"surface":"二百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0237","start":237,"end":241,"surface":"賓客昆弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0246","start":246,"end":250,"surface":"二百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0251","start":251,"end":252,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0270","start":270,"end":274,"surface":"四百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p028","text":"是時趙禹、張湯以深刻爲九卿矣，然其治尚寬，輔法而行，而縱以鷹撃毛摯爲治。後會五銖錢白金起，民爲姦，京師尤甚，乃以縱爲右内史，王温舒爲中尉。温舒至惡，其所爲不先言縱，縱必以氣淩之，敗壞其功。其治，所誅殺甚多，然取爲小治，姦益不勝，直指始出矣。吏之治以斬殺縛束爲務，閻奉以惡用矣。縱廉，其治放郅都。上幸鼎湖，病久，已而卒起幸甘泉，道多不治。上怒曰：「縱以我爲不復行此道乎？」嗛之。至冬，楊可方受告緡，縱以爲此亂民，部吏捕其爲可使者。天子聞，使杜式治，以爲廢格沮事，棄縱市。後一歳，張湯亦死。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"趙禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"閻奉","kind":"person","person_id":"0xp_j8o_cl2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"郅都","kind":"person","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0147","start":147,"end":148,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0168","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0173","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"楊可","kind":"person","person_id":"uxr_e45_mz7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0198","start":198,"end":199,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0210","start":210,"end":213,"surface":"可使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0219","start":219,"end":221,"surface":"杜式","kind":"person","person_id":"blc_s9z_o1j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0231","start":231,"end":232,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p030","text":"素居廣平時，皆知河内豪姦之家，及往，九月而至。令郡具私馬五十匹，爲驛自河内至長安，部吏如居廣平時方略，捕郡中豪猾，郡中豪猾相連坐千餘家。上書請，大者至族，小者乃死，家盡沒入償臧。奏行不過二三日，得可事。論報，至流血十餘里。河内皆怪其奏，以爲神速。盡十二月，郡中毋聲，毋敢夜行，野無犬吠之盜。其頗不得，失之旁郡國，黎來，會春，温舒頓足嘆曰：「嗟乎，令冬月益展一月，足吾事矣！」其好殺伐行威不愛人如此。天子聞之，以爲能，遷爲中尉。其治復放河内，徙諸名禍猾吏與從事，河内則楊皆、麻戊，關中楊贛、成信等。義縱爲内史，憚未敢恣治。及縱死，張湯敗後，徙爲廷尉，而尹齊爲中尉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0052","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"郡中豪猾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0057","start":57,"end":61,"surface":"郡中豪猾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0064","start":64,